Prismlet

This repository contains an independent, plain-PyTorch implementation of the
Sarvam-Prism forward pass and a study of routed-expert pruning.

The input encoding, the attention mask construction and the decision-head
arithmetic follow the official `sarvamai/prism` code, which is licensed under
the Apache License 2.0. The corresponding parts are:

  prismlet/encoder.py   input encoding and option formatting, from prism.py
  prismlet/head.py      decision head, from prism.py
  prismlet/rope.py      YaRN rotary tables, from modeling_sarvam_moe.py
  prismlet/layers.py    attention and MLP arithmetic, from modeling_sarvam_moe.py

The streaming loader, Intel XPU execution path, router statistics, pruning
writer and evaluation scripts are original work.

The model weights are not included and are not redistributed. They remain
subject to the licence published with `sarvamai/prism`.

